ally adjacent to it  The invasive and in situ lobular carcinoma cells are negative for e cadherin  by immunoperoxidase methods  Fibrocystic changes with sclerosing adenosis are adjacent to all three regions  The margins are negative for invasive and in situ carcinoma of both types  TABLE OF PATHOLOGICAL FINDINGS  1 INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  9 0 CLOCK  TUMOR SIZE  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  gross measurement  GRADE  2 LYMPHATIC VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  BLOOD VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  MARGIN OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  LOCATION OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  Within and beyond the region of the 9 o clock mass  GRADE OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  2 MARGIN OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  STAINS FOR RECEPTORS  Requested on block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   TABLE OF PATHOLOGICAL FINDINGS  2 INVASIVE LOBULAR CARCINOMA  11 0 CLOCK  TUMOR SIZE  REMOVED_DATE x 0 35cm  measured from slide  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   GRADE  2 LYMPHATIC VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  BLOOD VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  MARGIN OF INVASIVE LOBULAR CARCINOMA  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  LOCATION OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  Not identified adjacent to invasive lobular carcinoma mass  STAINS FOR RECEPTORS  Requested on block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   SKIN  LEFT BREAST   EXCISION  NO DIAGNOSTIC ABNORMALITY RECOGNIZED  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY  SENTINEL   EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  THE FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS IS CONFIRMED  NOTE  No cytokeratin positive tumor cells are identified on levels immunostained for pan keratin  cytokeratin cocktail  and cytokeratin 7  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  left axillary sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm portion of tan pink fibrofatty tissue  which is sectioned to reveal a